# ANCHR Protocol — Continue.dev

Before any work in this repository (run from the repo root):
1. Run python .anchr/anchr_tools.py STATUS (reports lock_exists). If lock_exists is true, stop and notify the human.
2. Run python .anchr/anchr_tools.py GRAPH_STATUS.
3. Read .anchr/start.md completely.
4. Follow start.md steps exactly, including Step 4 human confirmation.
5. Write .anchr/out/signal.json after every atomic step.

(On macOS/Linux use python3 if python is not Python 3.)
Operating contract: .anchr/manifesto.md
